I think the agentic workload might be a killer use case.

710
00:40:36,640 --> 00:40:39,503
네, 챗GPT가 애플리케이션
측면에서 하나의
Yeah, I think it's maybe a step change from, maybe, you know, ChatGPT was a step change in terms of application, right?

