They can talk to it and help them debug their code, look up information, analyze it, and synthesize information.

714
00:40:55,138 --> 00:41:01,200
찾고, 분석하고, 종합할 수 있게 됐죠.

715
00:41:01,200 --> 00:41:06,240
다음 세대 애플리케이션은
에이전틱일 거라고 생각해요.
I think the next set of applications is going to be agentic.

716
00:41:06,240 --> 00:41:09,619
그러니까 AI가, 이
