But as these workloads move to different verticals—let's say you're an engineer, I don't know, you're designing airplanes or something, right?

724
00:41:35,816 --> 00:41:40,000
예를 들어 엔지니어라면,
비행기를 설계한다고 해보죠.

725
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:46,160
모델이 여러분의 설계 소프트웨어에
접근할 수 있길 바라겠죠.
