I think that's going to be the main use case for more, like, professional level or enterprise level.

740
00:42:34,681 --> 00:42:38,079
주된 사용 사례가 될 거라고 생각해요.

741
00:42:38,079 --> 00:42:41,867
소비자 레벨에서는, 제가
